        "FLAT-KEY UNIT SPRITE\n\nThe 128x128 output is the canonical sprite layer. Every non-unit pixel is exact #FF00FF, which is absent from all faction subject palettes.\n\nThe unit uses the same faction colors, profile safe boxes, integer placement, and logical pixel grid as the preserved circle workflow. There is no ellipse, rim, dither, or alpha.\n\nUse AUTO for normal batches, or force infantry / vehicle / artillery when needed. The 512 output is only a nearest-neighbor review preview."
